     llddppccttll — control the LDP routing daemon

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     llddppccttll _c_o_m_m_a_n_d [_a_r_g_u_m_e_n_t _._._.]

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The llddppccttll program controls the ldpd(8) daemon.  Commands may be abbrevi‐
     ated to the minimum unambiguous prefix; for example, ss ii for sshhooww
     iinntteerrffaacceess.

     The following commands are available:

     cclleeaarr nneeiigghhbboorrss [_a_d_d_r_e_s_s]
             Delete entries from the neighbor table.  _a_d_d_r_e_s_s can be used to
             limit the scope of the command to the given neighbor.

     ffiibb ccoouuppllee
             Insert the learned labels into the Label Forwarding Information
             Base a.k.a.  the kernel routing table.

     ffiibb ddeeccoouuppllee
             Remove the learned labels from the Label Forwarding Information
             Base a.k.a.  the kernel routing table.

     lloogg bbrriieeff
             Disable verbose debug logging.

     lloogg vveerrbboossee
             Enable verbose debug logging.

     rreellooaadd  Reload the configuration file.

     sshhooww ffiibb [ffaammiillyy _f_a_m_i_l_y] [_d_e_s_t_i_n_a_t_i_o_n | _f_i_l_t_e_r]
             Show the Label Forwarding Information Base.  _f_a_m_i_l_y, if given,
             limit the output to the given address family.  _d_e_s_t_i_n_a_t_i_o_n can be
             specified to show the route matching a destination IP address.
             _f_i_l_t_e_r can be any of the following:

             ccoonnnneecctteedd               Show only connected routes.
             iinntteerrffaaccee               Show only interfaces.
             ssttaattiicc                  Show only static routes.

             ccoonnnneecctteedd, and ssttaattiicc may be specified together.

     sshhooww iinntteerrffaacceess [ffaammiillyy _f_a_m_i_l_y]
             Show details for all interfaces.  _f_a_m_i_l_y, if given, limit the
             output to the given address family.

     sshhooww ddiissccoovveerryy [ffaammiillyy _f_a_m_i_l_y]
             Show adjacencies.  _f_a_m_i_l_y, if given, limit the output to the
             given address family.

     sshhooww nneeiigghhbboorr [ffaammiillyy _f_a_m_i_l_y]
             Show neighbors.  _f_a_m_i_l_y, if given, limit the output to the given
             address family.

     sshhooww lliibb [ffaammiillyy _f_a_m_i_l_y]
             Show the Label Information Base.  _f_a_m_i_l_y, if given, limit the
             output to the given address family.

     sshhooww ll22vvppnn bbiinnddiinnggss
             Show the PWID Label Information Base.

     sshhooww ll22vvppnn ppsseeuuddoowwiirreess
             Show the status of the configured pseudowires.

